'''Spooky Thundia''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Halloween Capsules (Gacha Event)|Halloween Capsules]] event. She is an [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|anti-Dark]] variant of [[Thundia (Uber Rare Cat)|Thundia]]. She was added in [[Version 4.3 Update|Version 4.3]].

