}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Spooky Thundia, type β''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Good as support behind a wall of meatshields. She can be very useful on [[XP Stage]]s.

Long cooldown and a small amount of health make this unit basically an anti-Dark normal/evolved form [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut]]. However, her usage as an anti-Dark unit is limited by two things: her long attack rate and long foreswing. Most Dark enemies have many knockbacks and high damage, effectively nulling her damage. In that same sense, she can be useful against very tanky Dark enemies, such as [[Bun Bun Black]] and [[Dark Otter]]. [[Le'noir]], however, is not counted, as she barely outranges him. In summary, her long attack rate and attack cooldown limit her usage to only the most tanky Dark enemies, as others such as [[Shadow Boxer K]] will continue pushing regardless the damage she brings.

Without support from a strong frontline, Spooky Thundia will easily be knocked back and will later die, as her health is very low, especially when compared to other nukers; even the [[Twinstars (Uber Rare Cat)|Twinstars]] have better survivability than her. Given how damaging [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemies are, if the frontline breaks and she's hit, she's good as dead and the cherry on top is that area denial specialists such as [[Tackey]] and [[Two Can]] can reach and kill her regardless through range and waves.

In terms of generalist usage, she has very little, as her attack rate is an extremely slow with an overall mediocre damage, not enough to even balance the field in generalist testing stages such as [[At Least I'm a Cat]], [[Overachiever Central]] and [[No More Bad Dreams]].

