==Trivia==
*[[Version 5.5 Update|Version 5.5]] increased Spooky Thundia's HP, attack, movement speed and range.
**Prior to this version, Spooky Thundia's first form sported 800 base health while her second form sported 1,500 health. Spooky Thundia's first form sported a base 1,255 damage, while her second form sported 2,555 base damage. She also moved at 5 speed and stood at 410 range.
*Prior to [[Version 9.1 Update|Version 9.1]], Spooky Thundia's Evolved Form was named "Spooky Thundia β".
*Not counting [[Evangelist Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Evangelist Cat]] or [[:Category:Collaboration Event Cats|Collaboration Cats]], [[Hallowindy (Uber Rare Cat)|Hallowindy]] and Spooky Thundia are tied for the oldest existing Uber Rare Cats without [[True Form]]s.

